<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Pemex says it drops jet fuel prices.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Pemex says it drops jet fuel prices.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>State oil monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) lowered jet fuel prices to 1,805 pesos per cubic liter from 1,811 pesos, the state-owned oil company said Tuesday.</p>
<p>Pemex jet fuel prices have fluctuated from 1,253 pesos per cubic liter at the start of the year, rising 25 times and falling on 17 occasions.</p>
<p>--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728 7903</p>
